{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15108370","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15108370","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1510837001:0":{"text":"네가 치료를 잘한다고 이야기한 적 없었잖아.... 왜 말하지 않았던 거야?","source_cn":"你从来没说过你擅长治疗……为什么不告诉我？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x63A4362CC2D6147B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1510837002:0":{"text":"왜 이런 걸 이야기해야 해?","source_cn":"为什么要说这些？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x65A5CDB0272AA6F6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1510837003:0":{"text":"난 아직도 너에 대해서 잘 모르는 것 같으니까.","source_cn":"因为我觉得自己不够了解你。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8BCEEBA497E3B2B3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1510837004:0":{"text":"그게 중요해? 난 이미 너와 입을 맞추었어.","source_cn":"那重要吗？我已经吻过你了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6C89CDE743C0D4E5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1510837005:0":{"text":"...넌 항상 내 말문을 막는 재주가 있네.","source_cn":"……你总是让我不知该如何反驳。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8DD68FE8DCB8E8CD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1510837006:0":{"text":"세이툰의 창이 있는데도 다치다니. 정말 바보 같네.","source_cn":"有赛图恩的枪还会受伤，你是笨蛋。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x80636532FDD80ED7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1510837007:0":{"text":"그치만 이런 바보를 도와주는 사람이 있잖아.","source_cn":"但有人正在帮助这个笨蛋。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF8FDD030B8EC007E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1510837008:0":{"text":"날 너무 오랜만에 봐서 그런 거야? 나랑 떨어져 있으면 불안한가 보네.","source_cn":"是因为太久没见到我了吗？分离让你变得不安。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x151D4EDB074ECF78","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1510837009:0":{"text":"그럴지도.","source_cn":"也许是吧。<key:dialog2>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x52736B343B48AF42","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1510837010:1":{"text":"이거 받아.","source_cn":"收下它。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA5B879A774D8891B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"picture:11::2":{"text":"루가 선물한 목걸이","source_cn":"露送的项链","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6E64407A69984D5E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1510837011:1":{"text":"이건?","source_cn":"这是？<key:dialog1>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x13054EC5BB6DB885","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1510837012:1":{"text":"널 위해 만든 부적이야.","source_cn":"是我为你制作的护身符。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0D12F67D94EA5772","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1510837013:1":{"text":"이 부적이 널 지켜줄 거야. 이제부터 넌 그 누구의 사냥감도 아니야.","source_cn":"它可以保护你。从此之后，你不会成为任何人的猎物。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x70A068BB993BD2D2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1510837014:0":{"text":"날 느끼면서, 소중히 여겨 줘, 페르세우스.","source_cn":"珍惜它，珀尔修斯，感受我。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD4B6563F2D831F84","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1510837015:0":{"text":"그럴게.","source_cn":"我会的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3439B88003C90FA9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1510837016:1":{"text":"약속할 수 있어?","source_cn":"你保证？<key:dialog2>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1B77177C526B1D29","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1510837017:0":{"text":"약속할게.","source_cn":"我保证。<key:dialog2>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD7E3256D83F1FD8E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:珀尔修斯":{"text":"페르세우스","source":"珀尔修斯","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:露":{"text":"루","source":"露","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":19,"localized_text_count":18,"speaker_count":2}}